### 1. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "테스터",
  "skinType": "NORMAL",
  "skinConcerns": "ACNE,MOISTURE",
  "allergyIngredients": "향료, 알코올"
}

---

### 2. 로그인 (응답의 accessToken을 아래 {{token}}에 붙여넣기)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

---

### 3-1. OCR 테스트 — product1
POST http://localhost:8080/cosmetics/ocr
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc0MzYxODE2LCJleHAiOjE3NzQ0NDgyMTZ9.AMo7U7qbxtxpDzUXwxAMTwlIVKItBCnY9NJVjkSY3Uli9jRUWhg7MGWuPyeUWDCZ
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="frontImage"; filename="product1_front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/jaeboem/projects/skin_recipe/test-images/product1_front.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="backImage"; filename="product1_back.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/jaeboem/projects/skin_recipe/test-images/product1_back.jpg
--boundary--

---

